---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | CookMushroom" description="How CookMushroom handles analytics data, server logs, cookies, and messages sent to the site.">
  <main id="content" class="guide">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Effective July 10, 2026</p>
    <article class="prose">
      <p>CookMushroom is a public cooking reference. You can read the site without creating an account or submitting personal information.</p>
      <section>
        <h2>Information collected</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> the site measures page views and basic interactions. Google Analytics may collect device and browser details, approximate location, referring pages, and cookie or similar identifiers.</li>
          <li><strong>Server and security logs:</strong> our hosting and security provider, Cloudflare, may process IP addresses, request details, and security signals needed to deliver and protect the site.</li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> if you contact us, we receive the address and information you include in your message.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>How information is used</h2>
        <p>We use this information to operate and secure the site, understand which cooking guides are useful, improve site content, and reply to questions or corrections.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Service providers</h2>
        <p>CookMushroom uses Cloudflare for hosting and security and Google Analytics for traffic measurement. Those providers process data under their own privacy terms. CookMushroom does not sell personal information.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser, use content-blocking tools, or use Google’s Analytics opt-out tools. Blocking analytics does not prevent access to CookMushroom.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Retention and requests</h2>
        <p>Analytics and security data are retained according to the settings and policies of the services above. To ask about a message you sent or request its deletion, email <a href="mailto:hello@cookmushroom.com">hello@cookmushroom.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>Material changes will be posted on this page with a new effective date.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>